  "title": "Asian Salmon Foil-Pack Dinner",
  "description": "Tender, flaky salmon with veggies tucked inside an aluminum foil packet. The best part is that these can be made a day ahead of time, and clean up is a breeze.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
